WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.480
No!

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.640
It's not a lie!

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:04.990
Pirates really are going
to come, aren't they?

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:08.090
Yeah. They're definitely
gonna show up.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:10.420
But everyone thinks it's a lie!

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.430
I love this village!
I want to protect everyone!

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.560
Alright! We'll help you out!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.800
These are Klahadore's pirates
we're dealing with!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.070
Of course I'm scared!
What's wrong with that?!

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:24.510
We ain't laughing!

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.270
As if we'd risk our lives
because of sympathy!

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:36.180
"Clash with the Black Cat Pirates!
Great Battle on the Slope!"

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:05.150
Alright. They're going to attack
from this shore at daybreak.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:09.720
But the only route into
the village is this one slope.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:13.320
Everything else is cliff,
making it tougher to come through.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.660
In other words, if we can defend
this slope to the death,

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.560
the village won't get attacked!

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.430
Oh! That's easy!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.700
Talking about it is,
but the rest depends on our strength!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.300
What can you guys do?

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.170
Cut.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:28.100
Stretch.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.200
Steal.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.370
I can hide.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.170
You're gonna fight!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:35.610
I'm just kidding! Geez!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.220
<i>Oh, Klahadore-san!
Welcome back!</i>

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.520
How is she?

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:48.350
She's resting now.
She seemed quite exhausted...

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:55.430
But to think such a thing happened
while I was at the next town over...

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:58.470
That Usopp lad certainly
knows how to cause trouble.

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.570
Yes...

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:03.870
And of all things,
he claimed you were a pirate...

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:06.200
Such a transparent lie!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.470
Indeed.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.620
What is this?

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:22.860
Oh, that seems to be
a present from her to you.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.430
It's your third year
at this mansion,

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.000
so it's a sort
of commemoration.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.900
Commemoration...

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:34.000
Your current glasses seem
to slip often,

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.670
so she custom-ordered those!

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.830
She's such a nice,
thoughtful person!

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.220
A commemoration?

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.550
<i>Indeed, tomorrow
is a day to commemorate.</i>

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:52.540
Eh?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:02.860
It's a crescent moon tonight.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.130
Huh?

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:08.500
Nights like this
make my heart race,

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.500
and my blood stir...

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.310
<i>K- Klahadore-san!</i>

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:20.510
What are you doing
to her present?!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.580
Oh, I'll be accepting a present,
all right.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:28.250
But it won't be this -
it'll be this entire mansion!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.330
W-what are you saying?!

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.900
There is no more need
to continue the act.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:39.390
An accident is going to occur
in a few hours, anyway...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.740
It's truly been
three long years!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.070
Miss! Run away!

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.170
Captain Jango!

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:35.140
It's almost daybreak!
Please wake up, Captain Jango!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.910
--Good morning, Captain!
--Good morning!

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:42.160
You idiots!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:46.660
My policy is to say "good morning"
with the morning sun!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.030
<i>--He seems to be in a bad mood.
--He did just wake up...</i>

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:54.470
Just look! The moon's still up,
and it's the middle of the night!

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:56.240
How dare you shout loudly!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.540
Our apologies, sir!
We're sorry, sir!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.700
Alright, then.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.750
Good morning, fellows!

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.820
Good morning? That's the opposite
of what he just said!

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:18.930
You idiot! He's in a better
mood now, that's all!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.130
Oh!

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:22.620
Quit bein' confusing!

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:24.960
Men!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.530
Set sail!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.180
Alright! Perfect!

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:43.580
Now they won't be able
to climb up this slope,

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.320
thanks to all this oil
we've laid out here!

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.320
We'll let 'em slip and slide
on this slope,

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:53.260
then beat the crap out of
'em while they flail about!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.400
Oil, huh...

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.530
<i>No matter what,
we will protect this slope!</i>

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:02.800
Conversely, let's just hope
that none of us slip down there.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.210
It'd be like diving right
into an ant-lion pit.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:09.240
I'm amazed you can think up
stuff this cheeky!

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:10.780
But of course!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:13.650
When it comes to cheekiness
and slingshots,

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.640
I'm utterly confident!

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.630
It's almost daybreak.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.290
They'll be coming.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.090
We're here!

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.940
Alright, men! Go ashore!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:12.170
Trash the village
and head for the mansion!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.810
Captain! There are
two strange boats here!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:16.880
What?!

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.610
Shall I check them out?

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:21.420
Leave 'em.
They're not treasure ships.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.850
Don't screw up our schedule!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.180
Understood!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.520
Get going, you guys!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.190
Where are they?

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:36.400
The sky's all bright now.
What's the deal?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.600
Maybe they overslept
or something'?

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.530
No.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:43.770
They'll definitely show up.
Lot's of 'em.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:49.240
Say...

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.880
Maybe it's just
my imagination,

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.870
but I hear, "Yaaah!"
coming from somewhere...

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:02.320
Yeah, I definitely hear it!

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.220
N-now that you mention it...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.930
What?! What is it?!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.100
There's a place just like this
to the north, too!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.100
You don't suppose...

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.870
You mean this
is the wrong shore?!

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:16.670
This is where they
had their secret meeting,

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.330
so I just assumed...

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:21.310
Hey! Let's hurry!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:23.980
They're gonna get into the village!
Where is this place?!

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:28.180
If you run straight north from here,
you'll get there in three minutes!

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.150
The terrain there
is almost exactly the same,

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:32.290
so we just need to stop them
at the slope!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.120
Don't worry!
We'll do it somehow!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.190
Oh no!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:41.130
The north shore
is where our boats are!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.630
They're gonna take the treasure!

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.630
I'll be there in 20 seconds!

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:49.300
Dammit! My brilliant Oil
Strategy was all for nothing!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:50.840
My treasure...

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:52.010
Hey!

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.340
What're you doing?!
Let's go!

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:55.000
Y-yeah! We have to hurry-

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.080
Help! I'm falling!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:04.180
--Let go, you moron!
--Sorry!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.350
Perfect!

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:06.840
Thanks, Zoro!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.290
Sorry! The treasure's
in danger!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.630
Try to get
back up somehow!

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:19.760
That girl's gonna pay!

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:31.080
I refuse to let them
enter the village!

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:34.010
But Luffy sure runs fast!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.420
I can't even see him anymore!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.750
Straight north!
Straight north! Straight north!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.720
They're in big trouble
if they touch my treasure!

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:55.430
There's someone at
the top of the hill!

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:58.700
You!

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.990
My name is Captain Usopp!

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.650
I've been waiting for you
all this time!

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.760
I- I'm completely
ready to fight!

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.760
Turn back now,
if you don't wanna die!

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.840
<i>W-what the-?
I'm the first one here?!</i>

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:36.830
<i>But he was running
way ahead of me!</i>

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.660
Dammit!

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:59.260
What do I do?!
I can't climb up!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.310
I'm in the village now!
That's weird!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:09.300
He said north, so I ran
in a cold-ish direction!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:22.320
You're that boy who
overheard our plan.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.920
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.090
I- I'm warning you!
Turn back now while you still can!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.760
Or else my 100 million
crewmen will...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.990
...beat the crap
out of you guys!

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:35.340
100 million?

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.410
Hey, now! That's even worse
than a kid's lie!

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.610
What?! 100 million?!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:41.740
Wow!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.710
He's obviously lying, Captain!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.510
He's so naïve...

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.010
Yikes! They saw through it?!

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:50.080
He seriously thought
he could fool us, too...

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.520
<i>How dare you trick me!</i>

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.090
Captain Jango! Shocking news!

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:57.960
--Really?! That's bad!
--No! It's not bad!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.630
We found treasure
in those weird boats!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:04.130
An incredible amount!
Maybe 4, no, 5 million Berries!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.900
What?!

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:09.040
F-five million Berries?!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.530
Why is there that much money
in those guys' boats?

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.740
<i>That's my treasure!</i>

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:17.740
But you can have it!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.980
What?! You'll give
us the treasure?!

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.180
That's right!

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:26.290
In exchange for that treasure,
I ask that you turn back now!

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:29.420
Wha-?! You think you can
buy us off with money?!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:32.730
What a disgraceful guy!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:35.930
You fool.
We're pirates, you know.

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:39.470
We're obviously going
to take this treasure!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:44.240
It's not good enough of
a reason for us to turn back.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.570
Y-you have a point...

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:52.540
Alright, then! On "one, two, Jango",
you'll let us by!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:56.220
It's that weapon from before!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.450
One! Two!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.450
Jan-

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:02.120
Quit saying stupid crap!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.260
Oww!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.700
W-who's she?!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:14.730
Captain! This is no time to hypnotize
yourself and let people by!

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:18.310
That boat's treasure is mine!
I won't let you have a single Berry!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:21.840
Hold on to it!
I'll come take it back now!

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:23.180
That hurt!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.580
Who said you could give them
my treasure?!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.720
<i>What's wrong with just saying
they can have it?!</i>

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:32.450
What're you talking about?!
After I just saved you!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.250
Huh?

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:37.420
I forgot to mention it, but don't watch
his ring all the way through!

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:40.530
He's a hypnotist!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.400
H-hypnosis?!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:46.470
So? Where's Luffy?
He ran here first, right?

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:51.170
Dunno! He either
chickened out or got lost!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.170
He got lost, then.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:55.940
Geez! Just when we need him, too!

00:16:55.940 --> 00:17:00.110
I'll take command here.
Go kick their butts! I'll cover you!

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:02.550
Eh?! Hold on, why me?!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:06.590
There's no way I can take on
that huge army! I'm weak, you know!

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:08.220
Don't underestimate me
just 'cause I'm a guy!

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:11.690
I'm so scared my legs are
shaking like crazy! See?!

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:13.530
Big deal!

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.530
See, look! I'm so scared
I have tears in my eyes!

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.530
Your eyes are bone dry!

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.500
If you're gonna lie,
lie more realistically!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.600
I don't need you to tell me that!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.910
We don't have time
to mess with them.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:30.900
Crush 'em and head for
the village, men!

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:36.420
H-here they come!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.990
Oh, yeah!
I have caltrops!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.990
Oh! You do have
some good stuff!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:42.320
Gimme, gimme!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.760
Take this!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:49.420
Caltrop Hell!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:03.330
Damn that Nami!
She's gonna pay for this!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.480
I made it!

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:23.060
W-which way is
the north shore?!

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:27.290
Straight north!
Straight north! Straight north!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.380
Which way is north?!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.040
Oww!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.080
Yes! We got 'em!

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:44.570
Now! Special Attack:
Lead Star!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.190
Bastard!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.990
Way to go!
Keep it up, now!

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.160
I'm gonna quit fighting
for a bit.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.600
You haven't even fought yet!

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:58.130
What is it?!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.100
There are caltrops
behind us too...

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:03.260
<i>You moron!
You dropped 'em there!</i>

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:05.930
Outta the damn way!

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.240
Do you seriously think
you can stop us?

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:24.450
Let's go, guys!
Captain Kuro is waiting!

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.060
W-what the-?!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:34.200
Let go, you bastard!
Let the hell go!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:37.140
Damn you! Take this!
Take this!

00:19:37.140 --> 00:19:40.740
I... can't...

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.640
...let you get past
this slope...

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:49.750
Because I only lied
like I always do...

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:54.390
So the village is going to have
just another ordinary day...

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:57.720
So I absolutely won't
let you pass!

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:59.060
Damn kid! Shut up!

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.860
Damn girl!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.340
Oww!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:11.540
Are you-?!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.200
That's enough now!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.140
Hey, you guys!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.680
Quit bothering with them
and get going already!

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:24.550
Have you forgotten
this is Captain Kuro's plan?!

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.850
If anything happens
to throw his plan off,

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.420
he'll kill every one of us!

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:32.230
Do you understand that,
you dumbasses?!

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:35.220
--H-hey, now...
--Yeah, hurry to the village!

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.470
S-stop...

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.940
Dammit...

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:45.570
Stop!

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.570
Stop...
Don't go to the village!

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:48.910
Shut up!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:21:03.090
<i>Stop! Please!
Please don't kill everyone!</i>

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:08.260
<i>I love this village!
I want to protect it!</i>

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.950
W-what is this,
Captain Jango?!

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.550
Nobody mentioned guys like
them were in the village!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:30.880
About time...

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.090
What were those unchallenging
guys just now?!

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:40.760
Don't look at me!
I'm not satisfied, though!

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:44.260
Nami! How dare you
kick me down there!

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:45.930
Usopp, you jerk!

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:48.630
You didn't say
which way was north!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.570
Who're they?

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:00.710
They're late...

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:06.420
They all know full well
what happens...

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.410
...to those who
upset my plans...

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.960
They think they can take
their sweet time...

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:23.400
If they've already forgotten
that fact...

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:25.930
...then I'll slaughter them all!

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:48.360
<i>It is Klahadore
from the mansion!</i>

00:22:48.360 --> 00:22:50.030
Why is he walking
toward the shore,

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:52.020
this early
in the morning?!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
